author: pi-agent
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-10T15:10:46.453Z",pi-agent,"Applied the pm-beads PR 65 transformation: added pull-requests write permission, base_sha decide output, replaced publish-then-push with merge-PR verify publish tag-only ordering. dist is gitignored in this repo and is NOT included in the verify diff list."
